1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,969
Your city is haunted by garbage.

2
00:00:03,019 --> 00:00:04,527
This is Exorcity.

3
00:00:04,577 --> 00:00:07,209
Exorcise it, and get rewarded.

4
00:00:07,709 --> 00:00:14,290
In Indian cities, garbage dumped on roadsides, lakes and footpaths often has no owner, so it stays.

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:18,643
Exorcity turns every spot into a monster the whole city can see.

6
00:00:19,144 --> 00:00:21,467
This is the haunted map of Bengaluru.

7
00:00:21,517 --> 00:00:23,583
The spooky look carries meaning.

8
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:27,881
A bigger, redder, faster pulsing monster is a more urgent problem.

9
00:00:27,931 --> 00:00:35,192
Monsters grow with age, from new, to ancient horror after thirty days, and every five confirmations adds a level.

10
00:00:35,699 --> 00:00:41,686
When three or more spots appear within fifty metres in a month, the area becomes cursed, with a red aura.

11
00:00:41,736 --> 00:00:46,343
This cluster is linked to Green Meadows Society, the nearest responsible entity.

12
00:00:46,843 --> 00:00:53,807
For accessibility, every monster is also in a sortable list view, with keyboard support and a reduced motion switch.

13
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:57,113
Judges can try every role with one click.

14
00:00:57,163 --> 00:01:00,314
Let's log in as Asha, a citizen ghost hunter.

15
00:01:00,814 --> 00:01:02,493
Reporting takes seconds.

16
00:01:02,543 --> 00:01:07,246
Pick the type, describe it, add a photo, and drop a pin with GPS.

17
00:01:07,296 --> 00:01:13,728
Exorcity links the spot to the nearest society, campus or shop within two hundred metres.

18
00:01:14,227 --> 00:01:16,148
Other hunters confirm sightings.

19
00:01:16,198 --> 00:01:21,321
Confirming earns five points, and the reporter earns ten on the first confirmation.

20
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:24,964
To clean a spot, add an after photo and exorcise it.

21
00:01:25,014 --> 00:01:32,089
The monster vanishes in smoke, the cleaner earns twenty five points, and a before and after slider proves the work.

22
00:01:32,595 --> 00:01:40,584
Every action feeds a Civic Score from zero to nine hundred, with ratings from Cursed to Ghost Free, reward points, and a full audit trail.

23
00:01:41,088 --> 00:01:43,601
Responsible entities get a dashboard too.

24
00:01:43,651 --> 00:01:47,165
Green Meadows has four cursed spots and a Cursed rating.

25
00:01:47,215 --> 00:01:52,542
Fast cleanups earn points, and a daily job penalises spots left open for over a week.

26
00:01:53,041 --> 00:01:59,115
Ward officers see every open spot in their ward, scariest first, and can reject fake reports.

27
00:01:59,622 --> 00:02:06,156
Leaderboards celebrate the best ghost hunters and the cleanest societies and campuses, and expose the most haunted wards.

28
00:02:06,657 --> 00:02:09,080
Exorcity was built spec first with Kiro.

29
00:02:09,130 --> 00:02:18,971
Four steering documents, nine specs with EARS requirements, agent hooks, and property based tests proving the score always stays between zero and nine hundred.

30
00:02:19,485 --> 00:02:20,263
Exorcity.

31
00:02:20,313 --> 00:02:23,298
Your city is haunted by garbage.

32
00:02:23,348 --> 00:02:26,149
Exorcise it, and get rewarded.
